LetMany([
["ask",Fn(["req"],OnAccepted(Ask(Ref("req")),Fn(["content","exchange"],Construct({"ok":true,"value":Get(Ref("content"),"reply")})),Fn(["stop"],Construct({"ok":false,"status":Get(Ref("stop"),"action")}))))],
["review",Fn(["name","color"],Let("r",Call(Ref("ask"),Construct({"message":Concat("Badge: ",Ref("name")," | Color: ",Ref("color"),". Say done, change name, or change color."),"suggestions":Arr("done","change name","change color")})),If(Get(Ref("r"),"ok"),If(Eq(Get(Ref("r"),"value"),"done"),Construct({"status":"done","name":Ref("name"),"color":Ref("color")}),If(Eq(Get(Ref("r"),"value"),"change name"),Let("n",Call(Ref("ask"),Construct({"message":"What is your new name?"})),If(Get(Ref("n"),"ok"),Call(Ref("review"),Get(Ref("n"),"value"),Ref("color")),Construct({"status":Get(Ref("n"),"status")}))),If(Eq(Get(Ref("r"),"value"),"change color"),Let("c",Call(Ref("ask"),Construct({"message":"What is your new favorite color?"})),If(Get(Ref("c"),"ok"),Call(Ref("review"),Ref("name"),Get(Ref("c"),"value")),Construct({"status":Get(Ref("c"),"status")}))),Call(Ref("review"),Ref("name"),Ref("color"))))),Construct({"status":Get(Ref("r"),"status")}))))]
],
Let("r1",Call(Ref("ask"),Construct({"message":"What is your name?"})),If(Get(Ref("r1"),"ok"),Let("r2",Call(Ref("ask"),Construct({"message":"What is your favorite color?"})),If(Get(Ref("r2"),"ok"),Call(Ref("review"),Get(Ref("r1"),"value"),Get(Ref("r2"),"value")),Construct({"status":Get(Ref("r2"),"status")}))),Construct({"status":Get(Ref("r1"),"status")}))))
